# Recursion – Print 1 to 5

## Question 1

**Problem:**  
Write a Java program using recursion to print numbers from 1 to 5.

### Java Code

```java
public class P1 {

    public static void print(int i) {

        if (i <= 5) {
            System.out.println(i);
            print(i + 1);
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        print(1);
    }
}
```

### Sample Output

```text
1
2
3
4
5
```
